WEBVTT

00:00.360 --> 00:10.760
Your son believes that honest counsel grates on the ear, yet benefits conduct. Decades have passed since our dynasty fled south—yet the people suffering under Wunu tyranny in the North long for their homeland every passing day.

00:11.360 --> 00:20.440
For over a decade, the court has launched no northern campaign. While meant to give the nation respite, it remains an indisputable truth that we have turned our backs on the northern folk and abandoned our ancestral lands.

00:21.240 --> 00:27.640
Are you saying... that your Emperor was wrong?
Your son would never dare! I only pray Father Emperor will place the realm above all else.
